{"parentUuid":"a49c7cf2-3f80-41b3-8ee9-e6310f09867c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"8991ed8c-6615-4baa-8a4b-69a41242ec40","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder>\n## The user forked this session from another session\n\nThe user forked this session at this point to ask something on the side; continue from here on whatever they ask. Nothing you say here is reported automatically to `local_8543c787-aaef-4c65-89a8-584174a81e72`, the original session this conversation was forked from. You can message it with `SendMessage` (`to`: that session id) if you need something only it knows, or when the user asks you to pass something on. Link a session whenever you mention one, so the user can open it with a click: [its title](#local_<id>), using the `local_…` id a tool result, note or this prompt gave you, never one you made up.\n</system-reminder>\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"> Render. It’s the highest-value gap: judges and users could try Ward without installing anything. It means the web app and case viewer as static sites, plus the bot. This is the one step that needs you, to connect Render.\n> A v0.1.0 preview release, once your four signing secrets are set. That makes the download links and “Give Ward to a friend” real.\n> The help-page checker (Browserbase + SerpApi), if you have keys or credits for both. It’s a genuine use of both: it keeps the Coach’s instructions true as the apps change their menus.\n> Re-import Entire checkpoints for the work since the last import.\n\nim done with steps 1 and 2, can you launch sub sessions to do steps 3 and 4"}]},"uuid":"bea9cf1c-e29d-4cb7-8066-b11f87197dd5","timestamp":"2026-11-01T00:37:31.611Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":47,"turnIndex":70},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/haider/Desktop/Hacktoberfest 26/ward","sessionId":"a340ebaf-8965-489c-88cd-9f351923c756","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"federated-questing-pine"}
