{"parentUuid":"a8e0b875-2036-4c1a-b469-4510736dd5a8","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_additional_context","content":["## The user forked this session from another session\n\nThe user forked this session at this point to ask something on the side; continue from here on whatever they ask. Nothing you say here is reported automatically to `local_8543c787-aaef-4c65-89a8-584174a81e72`, the original session this conversation was forked from. You can message it with `SendMessage` (`to`: that session id) if you need something only it knows, or when the user asks you to pass something on. Link a session whenever you mention one, so the user can open it with a click: [its title](#local_<id>), using the `local_…` id a tool result, note or this prompt gave you, never one you made up."],"hookName":"SessionStart","toolUseID":"SessionStart","hookEvent":"SessionStart"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"ee9eca1e-5297-4468-8564-5a6c647c82dd","timestamp":"2026-11-01T00:38:21.361Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nSessionStart hook additional context: ## The user forked this session from another session\n\nThe user forked this session at this point to ask something on the side; continue from here on whatever they ask. Nothing you say here is reported automatically to `local_8543c787-aaef-4c65-89a8-584174a81e72`, the original session this conversation was forked from. You can message it with `SendMessage` (`to`: that session id) if you need something only it knows, or when the user asks you to pass something on. Link a session whenever you mention one, so the user can open it with a click: [its title](#local_<id>), using the `local_…` id a tool result, note or this prompt gave you, never one you made up.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/haider/Desktop/Hacktoberfest 26/ward","sessionId":"a340ebaf-8965-489c-88cd-9f351923c756","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"federated-questing-p